#*: Another knight came to settle on the island, a man of much '''weight''' and position, on whom the Adelantados of all the island relied, and who was made a magistrate.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1945|author=Mikia Pezas|title=The price of liberty|publisher=I. Washburn, Inc.|page=11
|passage="You surely are a man of some '''weight''' around here," I said.}}
# {{lb|en|weightlifting}} An object, such as a [[weight plate]] or [[barbell]], used for [[strength training]].
#: {{ux|en|He's working out with '''weights'''.}}
# {{lb|en|lubricants}} [[viscosity|Viscosity]] rating.
# {{senseid|en|molecular weight}}{{lb|en|physics}} [[mass|Mass]] ([[atomic weight]], [[molecular weight]], etc.) {{qualifier|in restricted circumstances}}
