# {{lb|en|topology}} The smallest [[cardinality]] of a base.
# {{lb|en|typography}} The [[boldness]] of a [[font]]; the relative thickness of its [[stroke]]s.
#: {{coi|en|font '''weight'''}}
# {{lb|en|visual art}} The relative thickness of a drawn [[rule]] or painted [[brushstroke]], [[line weight]].
# {{lb|en|visual art}} The [[illusion]] of [[mass]].
# {{lb|en|visual art}} The [[thickness]] and [[opacity]] of [[paint]].
# {{lb|en|figurative}} [[pressure|Pressure]]; [[burden]].
#: {{ux|en|the '''weight''' of care or business}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare King Lear|act=V|scene=iii|page=309|column=2|passage=The '''waight''' of this ſad time we muſt obey{{...}}}}
