#: {{ux|en|He was pushing '''weight'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Noire Thug-A-Licious|page=103|passage=The three of us were hanging out rapping in Hamilton projects with some niggahs Pimp had got tight with on Rikers Island. Them fools had done a push-in and took over some old lady's apartment, and they were in there cutting crack and mixing '''weight'''.}}
# {{lb|en|slang|countable}} One [[pound]] of drugs, especially [[cannabis]].
