|passage=[I was] doing a '''weight''' [1 lb. at that time] a week, sometimes more, sometimes less.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2009|author=Martina Cole|title=The Ladykiller|passage=The ones the CIB should be looking out for, to her mind, were the officers who raided a flat, found a couple of '''weights''' of cannabis and stashed half of it before they made the collar. The cannabis would make its way back on to the street {{...}}}}
