# {{lb|en|especially in|_|computing}} [[emphasis|Emphasis]] applied to a given [[criterion]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2024|author=Laura Masbruch|title=Pasta Land|passage=“Logits” are the [[vector]]s of '''weights'''.}}
